WEBVTT

NOTE The Cure (1917) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The Health Spring

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.200
[music]

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:19.750
The man who
discovered the spring

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.500
To be cured of drinking

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.500
His wardrobe

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:15.250
"Come take the waters"

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:17.750
"Try our water and
you'll never drink again"

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.000
"You're better already!"

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:59.000
"Throw this liquor out"

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:55.750
Their after dinner drink

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.500
"You're next!"

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:47.500
The waters have a strange effect

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:32.750
"These waters will
keep you sober"

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:39.000
"Drink it for my sake"

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:10.250
"For your sake"

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:48.500
The next morning

00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:44.500
"Forgive me, that well
was full of liquor"

00:24:51.000 --> 00:24:54.000
"Please don't"
